.TH GENETREE 1 2000-1月 "get_context" "get_context"
.SH NAME
get_context \- Get the expression state context that is currently applied on the model.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIget_context(\fBtree\fR as <generic> XGBoostGRN, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Get the expression state context that is currently applied on the model.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBtree\fB \fR\- the trained [XGBoostGRN](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.GeneTree.XGBoostGRN) model object.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a list with the slots \fBgenes\fR, \fBexpression\fR, \fBfix\fR, \fBaligned\fR,
 \fBclamp_genes\fR, \fBnote\fR and \fBunknown\fR(the gene ids that could not be mapped
 onto the model), the \fBgenes\fR slot is an empty character vector when no context
 has been applied.
.PP
